+The `stats` command gives you a quick whole-store summary — total spent, number of
+expenses, average, and the date range covered:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli stats
+```
+
+If you have monthly budgets set up, `budget` shows how much of each category budget
+you have used in a given month:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+The budgets themselves live in `tally/config.py` under `CATEGORY_BUDGETS`. They are
+just a plain dictionary, so editing the dollar figures there is all you need to do
+to adjust them.
+
